title: "System Evolution: Open Preprint Series"
abstract: >-
  A self-hosted, open, arXiv-style preprint series on the first-principles
  physics of learning and intelligence, substrate reinforcement learning,
  thermodynamic ledgers of causality, oscillatory cognitive substrates, and the
  verifiable-execution harness of a single-principal agent fleet. Every preprint
  ships a PDF + interactive HTML + SHA-256 + BibTeX. Stable identifiers use the
  scheme SE-YYYY.NNNNN.
